  sig=func newApprover(in *bufio.Reader, rep *stdoutReporter) delegate.Approver
  doc=newApprover returns an Approver that prompts on the shared stdin reader.\nSafe because Chat (and thus any gate) runs synchronously while the REPL is\nblocked, so there is never a concurrent read of stdin.
